Encapsulation ?
It is a process of wrapping (binding) and data members or a variables and theter related methodes into a single unit is called encapsulation.
It is also reffered as process of grouping and protecting data inside a class.
It helps in data hiding and controled access to the data.

Rules.
1  declare variables as private.
2  provide public getter method ----to read data.
3  provide public setter method ----to modifi or set data.

The best example for Encapsulation is a Java Bean Class
